+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+No cache eviction policy is currently recorded for this project. An earlier proposal to switch to LRU with a 300-second TTL was superseded by a later commit that revoked the cache eviction decision (`config/decisions/revoke-cache-eviction.json`), and no replacement value has been recorded since. Until a new decision is recorded, this policy should be treated as undecided.
